quin-chamorro-cardenal.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pedro Joaquín Chamorro Cardenal</span><span class="tp">1924–1978</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/souvanna-phouma"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/souvanna-phouma.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Souvanna Phouma</span><span class="tp">1901–1984</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/qaboos-bin-said"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Qaboos bin Said</span><span class="tp">1940–2020</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/constantine-ii-of-greece"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/constantine-ii-of-greece.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Constantine II of Greece</span><span class="tp">1940–2023</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
